cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived release (Zenodo DOI) and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "ADR-SSA: An Enhanced Sparrow Search Algorithm for Complex Optimization and Data-Driven Forecasting (Execution Code)"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB execution code for ADR-SSA, an enhanced Sparrow Search Algorithm that combines dynamic
  reverse learning with adaptive t-distribution mutation. The package contains the ADR-SSA
  implementation, the CEC2022 comparison and component-ablation scripts, the constrained
  engineering design experiments (welded beam and pressure vessel problems), the convergence-curve
  and population-diversity analysis utilities, and the compiled CEC2022 benchmark suite for
  Windows x64. Results reported in the manuscript cover the CEC2022 benchmark, CEC2017 functions
  at 30/50/100 dimensions, two constrained engineering design problems, and an ADR-SSA-optimized
  CatBoost model for provincial carbon emission forecasting.
